  "researchNotes": "The official Louis Vuitton perfume listing (us.louisvuitton.com all-perfumes page) returned HTTP 403, and so did Parfumo and Fragrantica brand pages, so no official or database listing page could be read for the range. The range was taken from the Olfastory Louis Vuitton brand listing (louis-vuitton-malletier, pages 1 and 2, 20 fragrances) and each product's Olfastory page, so notes are recorded as reported. Ombre Nomade is not on the Olfastory listing; it was added from a Scento product page that states its notes and perfumer, with concentration not stated, so it is null. Concentration is null where the page gives none (California Dream, City Of Stars, Symphony, Pacific Chill, which also conflicts between eau de parfum and eau de cologne on its page). Pacific Chill's notes are not split into tiers on the page, so they are in flat. Launch years and perfumers are included only where the page states them. Other Louis Vuitton fragrances named only in search summaries (for example L'Immensite, Spell on You, Sun Song) were not added because no opened page confirmed their notes. Brand-level country not stated on any page read.",
